{"id":"a1965295379dd836","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-projection-compat.md","title":"projection — Compatibility alias","display":"projection — Compatibility alias","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-projection-compat","aliases":["16-df-projection-compat","16-projection"],"display":"projection — Compatibility alias","depends_on":["[[16-df-projection]]"],"revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-projection-compat"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-projection-compat</span><span>16-projection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"projection — Compatibility alias"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca928a31eb017424\" href=\"?note=ca928a31eb017424\" title=\"16-df-projection\">16-df-projection</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本页取集合模型：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U\">\\(A:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U\\)</span> 为小集合族；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma.A\">\\(\\Gamma.A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_A\">\\(\\pi_A\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca928a31eb017424\" href=\"?note=ca928a31eb017424\" title=\"16-df-projection\">16-df-projection</a> 的规范入口，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_A^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\">\\(\\pi_A^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\\)</span> 是下式定义的同一函数的别名。</li>\n<li>固定 Grothendieck 宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\Gamma\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>；沿用规范入口的同一实例：环境宇宙 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>、码集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathcal U}(\\Gamma)\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Ty}_{\\mathcal U}(\\Gamma)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi_A^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\\coloneqq\\pi_A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi_A^{\\mathrm{legacy}}\\coloneqq\\pi_A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>规范的语境投影及其与 comprehension 的关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca928a31eb017424\" href=\"?note=ca928a31eb017424\" title=\"16-df-projection\">16-df-projection</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-projection","status":"resolved","id":"ca928a31eb017424","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-projection]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-projection","status":"resolved","id":"ca928a31eb017424","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本页取集合模型：$\\Gamma$ 为集合，$A:\\Gamma\\to\\mathcal U$ 为小集合族；$\\Gamma.A$ 与 $\\pi_A$ 采用 [[16-df-projection]] 的规范入口，$\\pi_A^{\\mathrm{legacy}}$ 是下式定义的同一函数的别名。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-projection","status":"resolved","id":"ca928a31eb017424","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"规范的语境投影及其与 comprehension 的关系见 [[16-df-projection]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamm